helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	Admissió de plataforma Java				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0650.xhp\" name=\"Soport de la plataforma Java\"\>Soport de la plataforma Java\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	ca-XR	$[officename] soporta la plataforma Java per a córrer aplicacions i components basats en l'arquitectura JavaBeans.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	ca-XR	Per a que $[officename] puga utilisar la plataforma Java, deu instalar el software Java 2 Runtime Environment. Quan instalà $[officename], tingué automàticament l'opció d'instalar estos archius si no estaven instalats. També pot instalar estos archius ara si és necessari.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	ca-XR	L'admissió de plataforma Java es deu activar en $[officename] per a poder eixecutar aplicacions de Java.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	ca-XR	Activar la compatibilitat en la plataforma Java, seleccionant \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferències\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ferramentes - Opcions\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/java.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Java\"\>$[officename] - Java\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id9116183				0	ca-XR	Before you can use a JDBC driver, you need to add its class path. Choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Java, and click the Class Path button. After you add the path information, restart %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	ca-XR	Your modifications at the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Java\</emph\> tab page will be used even if the Java Virtual Machine (JVM, a virtual machine for the Java platform) already has been started. After modifications to the ClassPath you must restart $[officename]. The same is true for modifications under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet - Proxy\</emph\>. Only the two boxes "HTTP Proxy" and "FTP Proxy" and their ports don't require a restart, they will be evaluated when you click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0800.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	$[officename] i Internet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0800.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] i Internet\"\>$[officename] i Internet\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0800.xhp	0	help	par_id3155150				0	ca-XR	En esta secció s'oferix informació sobre Internet. Un \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp\" name=\"glossari d'Internet\"\>glossari d'Internet\</link\> explica els térmens més rellevants.				20200411 15:09:53
