helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760	2			0	ca-XR	\<variable id=\"basic\"\>$[officename] es pot controlar per mig de l'API d'$[officename]. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111				0	ca-XR	$[officename] utilisa un nou component API (Application Programming Interface) que permet controlar diversos components d'$[officename] a través de diversos llenguages. Per als nous interfaços existix un $[officename] Software Development Kit.				20200411 15:09:53
