helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154142				0	ca-XR	See also \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03104200.xhp\" name=\"Array\"\>Array\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	ca-XR	If no parameters are passed, an empty array is created (like Dim A() that is the same as a sequence of length 0 in Uno). If parameters are specified, a dimension is created for each parameter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154760				0	ca-XR	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104300.xhp	0	help	par_id3159414				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Argument list:\</emph\> A list of any number of arguments that are separated by commas.				20200411 15:09:53
