helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149178	8			0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Expression: \</emph\>Any numeric expression.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146958				0	ca-XR	The \<emph\>Str\</emph\> function converts a numeric variable, or the result of a calculation into a string. Negative numbers are preceded by a minus sign. Positive numbers are preceded by a space (instead of the plus sign).				20200411 15:09:53
