helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146958				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03100700.xhp\" name=\"Const Statement [Runtime]\"\>Const Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	ca-XR	Defines a string as a constant.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150670				0	ca-XR	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	ca-XR	Const Text = Expression				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147530				0	ca-XR	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any constant name that follows the standard variable naming conventions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3147264				0	ca-XR	A constant is a variable that helps to improve the readability of a program. Constants are not defined as a specific type of variable, but rather are used as placeholders in the code. You can only define a constant once and it cannot be modified. Use the following statement to define a constant:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3150542				0	ca-XR	CONST ConstName=Expression				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400				0	ca-XR	The type of expression is irrelevant. If a program is started, $[officename] Basic converts the program code internally so that each time a constant is used, the defined expression replaces it.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154366				0	ca-XR	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3145420				0	ca-XR	Sub ExampleConst				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154217				0	ca-XR	Const iVar = 1964				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156281				0	ca-XR	Msgbox iVar				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969				0	ca-XR	Const sVar = "Program", dVar As Double = 1.00				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149560				0	ca-XR	Msgbox sVar & " " & dVar				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153368				0	ca-XR	end sub				20200411 15:09:53
