helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153311	9			0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Msg\</emph\>: String expression displayed as the message in the dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315	10			0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Title\</emph\>: String expression displayed in the title bar of the dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307	11			0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Default\</emph\>: String expression displayed in the text box as default if no other input is given.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573	12			0	ca-XR	\<emph\>x_pos\</emph\>: Integer expression that specifies the horizontal position of the dialog. The position is an absolute coordinate and does not refer to the window of the office application.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3156024	13			0	ca-XR	\<emph\>y_pos\</emph\>: Integer expression that specifies the vertical position of the dialog. The position is an absolute coordinate and does not refer to the window of the office application.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	ca-XR	If \<emph\>x_pos\</emph\> and \<emph\>y_pos\</emph\> are omitted, the dialog is centered on the screen. The position is specified in \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp#twips\" name=\"twips\"\>twips\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
