helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825				0	ca-XR	oIntrospection = oServiceManager.createInstance("com.sun.star.beans.Introspection");				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	par_id3148473				0	ca-XR	this is the same as the following statement:				20200411 15:09:53
