helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153345				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030103.xhp\" name=\"Day Function [Runtime]\"\>Day Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560				0	ca-XR	Returns a value that represents the day of the month based on a serial date number generated by \<emph\>DateSerial\</emph\> or \<emph\>DateValue\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149456				0	ca-XR	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	ca-XR	Day (Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148798				0	ca-XR	Return value:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3125865				0	ca-XR	Integer				20200411 15:09:53
