helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120102.xhp	0	help	par_id3159414				0	ca-XR	Use the \<emph\>Chr$\</emph\> function to send special control sequences to a printer or to another output source. You can also use it to insert quotation marks in a string expression.				20200411 15:09:53
