helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120102.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909				0	ca-XR	REM This example inserts quotation marks (ASCII value 34) in a string.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120102.xhp	0	help	par_id3151380				0	ca-XR	MsgBox "A "+ Chr$(34)+"short" + Chr$(34)+" trip."				20200411 15:09:53
