helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020300.xhp	0	help	par_id631733				0	ca-XR	End Sub				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020300.xhp	0	help	par_id8234199				0	ca-XR	REM ***** Module2 *****				20200411 15:09:53
