helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090410.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148554				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090410.xhp\" name=\"Switch Function [Runtime]\"\>Switch Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090410.xhp	0	help	par_id3148522				0	ca-XR	Evaluates a list of arguments, consisting of an expression followed by a value. The Switch function returns a value that is associated with the expression that is passed by this function.				20200411 15:09:53
