helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154367				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020304.xhp\" name=\"Seek Function [Runtime]\"\>Seek Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	ca-XR	Returns the position for the next writing or reading in a file that was opened with the open statement.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	par_id3153194				0	ca-XR	For random access files, the Seek function returns the number of the next record to be read.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	par_id3161831				0	ca-XR	For all other files, the function returns the byte position at which the next operation is to occur.				20200411 15:09:53
