helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020302.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148663				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020302.xhp\" name=\"Loc Function [Runtime]\"\>Loc Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020302.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	ca-XR	Returns the current position in an open file.				20200411 15:09:53
