helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	ca-XR	Print ASC("Z") REM returns 90				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120101.xhp	0	help	par_id3163800				0	ca-XR	Print ASC("Las Vegas") REM returns 76, since only the first character is taken into account				20200411 15:09:53
