helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020413.xhp	0	help	par_id3154367				0	ca-XR	RmDir Text As String				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020413.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156281				0	ca-XR	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020413.xhp	0	help	par_id3151042				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any string expression that specifies the name and path of the directory that you want to delete. You can also use \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp\" name=\"URL notation\"\>URL notation\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020413.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	ca-XR	If the path is not determined, the \<emph\>RmDir Statement\</emph\> searches for the directory that you want to delete in the current path. If it is not found there, an error message appears.				20200411 15:09:53
