helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154923				0	ca-XR	Addresses the active component so that its properties can be read and set. ThisComponent is used from document Basic, where it represents the document the Basic belongs to. The type of object accessed by ThisComponent depends on the document type.				20200411 15:09:53
