helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150986				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03060500.xhp\" name=\"Or-Operator [Runtime]\"\>Or Operator [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	ca-XR	Performs a logical OR disjunction on two expressions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148664				0	ca-XR	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	ca-XR	Result = Expression1 Or Expression2				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151211				0	ca-XR	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Result:\</emph\> Any numeric variable that contains the result of the disjunction.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147229				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Expression1, Expression2:\</emph\> Any numeric expressions that you want to compare.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	ca-XR	A logical OR disjunction of two Boolean expressions returns the value True if at least one comparison expression is True.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	ca-XR	A bit-wise comparison sets a bit in the result if the corresponding bit is set in at least one of the two expressions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3161831				0	ca-XR	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147427				0	ca-XR	Sub ExampleOr				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153142				0	ca-XR	Dim vA as Variant, vB as Variant, vC as Variant, vD as Variant				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154014				0	ca-XR	Dim vOut as Variant				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155856				0	ca-XR	vA = 10: vB = 8: vC = 6: vD = Null				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152460				0	ca-XR	vOut = vA > vB Or vB > vC REM -1				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147349				0	ca-XR	vOut = vB > vA Or vB > vC REM -1				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151114				0	ca-XR	vOut = vA > vB Or vB > vD REM -1				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	ca-XR	vOut = (vB > vD Or vB > vA) REM 0				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152598				0	ca-XR	vOut = vB Or vA REM 10				20200411 15:09:53
