helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030130.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F6				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Add\</emph\> - A string expression from the following table, specifying the date interval.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030130.xhp	0	help	par_idN10604				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Date\</emph\> - The date from which the result is calculated.				20200411 15:09:53
