helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159171				0	ca-XR	Document is closing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146868				0	ca-XR	...before a document is closed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159097				0	ca-XR	Document closed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148606				0	ca-XR	...after a document was closed. Note that the "Save Document" event may also occur when the document is saved before closing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144772				0	ca-XR	Activate Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149442				0	ca-XR	...after a document is brought to the foreground.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150888				0	ca-XR	Deactivate Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154060				0	ca-XR	...after another document is brought to the foreground.				20200411 15:09:53
