helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152873				0	ca-XR	...after the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog is closed, but before the actual print process begins.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159227				0	ca-XR	JavaScript run-time error				20200411 15:09:53
