helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153555				0	ca-XR	...after the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog is closed, but before the actual print process begins. This event occurs for each copy printed.				20200411 15:09:53
