helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146098				0	ca-XR	Select whether you want the assignment to be globally valid or just valid in the current document in the \<emph\>Save In\</emph\> listbox.				20200411 15:09:53
