helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101600.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	ca-XR	DefVar v				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101600.xhp	0	help	par_id3146121				0	ca-XR	Sub ExampleDefLng				20200411 15:09:53
