helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DefaultBullet\"\>Assigns bullet points to the selected paragraphs, or removes them from bulleted paragraphs.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155150				0	ca-XR	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Bullet options such as type and position are defined in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06050000.xhp\" name=\"Bullets and Numbering\"\>\<emph\>Bullets and Numbering\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. To open this dialog, click the \<emph\>Bullets and Numbering\</emph\> icon on the \<link href=\"text/swriter/main0206.xhp\" name=\"Bullets and Numbering Bar\"\>Bullets and Numbering Bar\</link\>\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
