helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072B				0	ca-XR	On the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> bar, click the \<emph\>Highlighting\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10736				0	ca-XR	To change the highlighting color, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Highlighting\</emph\> icon, and then click the color that you want.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073E				0	ca-XR	Select the text that you want to highlight.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10743				0	ca-XR	To apply highlighting to a single word, double-click the word.				20200411 15:09:53
