helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156183				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>database contents; inserting as tables\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183	18			0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:RB_AS_TABLE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts data selected from the data source browser into the document as a table.\</ahelp\>In the \<emph\>Insert Database Columns\</emph\> dialog, select the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> option to insert the selected data into the document as a table. In the dialog, you can decide which database fields or columns are transferred, and how the text table is formatted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152594				0	ca-XR	Table				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152918				0	ca-XR	In the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> area, use the arrow keys to select the columns of the database table that you want to apply to the text table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156042				0	ca-XR	Database columns				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152425	20			0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:LB_TBL_DB_COLUMN\"\>Specifies the database columns to be inserted into the text table.\</ahelp\> All database table columns that have not been accepted in the \<emph\>Table column(s)\</emph\> list box are listed here. The entries are sorted alphabetically. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147577				0	ca-XR	Table column(s)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:LB_TABLE_COL\"\>Lists all database columns to be inserted into the document.\</ahelp\> A column will be assigned to each corresponding entry in the table. The entry order in the \<emph\>Table column(s)\</emph\> list box determines the data order in the text table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146958				0	ca-XR	>>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149750				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_IMAGEBUTTON_DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL_IB_DBCOL_ALL_TO\"\>Moves all listed database fields into the \<emph\>Table column(s)\</emph\> list box.\</ahelp\> All fields listed in the \<emph\>Table column(s)\</emph\> list box are inserted into the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163802				0	ca-XR	>				20200411 15:09:53
