helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147226	4			0	ca-XR	The\<emph\> Apply Filter \</emph\>function retains \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12110000.xhp\" name=\"form-based filters\"\>form-based filters\</link\> that have been set. You do not need to redefine them.				20200411 15:09:53
