helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148990				0	ca-XR	Further information can be found in the Help in \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"Borders\"\>\<emph\>Borders\</emph\>\</link\>. You can also find information on how to \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/border_table.xhp\" name=\"format a text table\"\>format a text table\</link\> with the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
