helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154682				0	ca-XR	Hyperlinks to any document or targets in documents can be edited using the \<emph\>Document\</emph\> tab from the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink dialog\"\>Hyperlink dialog\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
