helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id9462263				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter a URL for the file that you want to open when you click the hyperlink. If you do not specify a target frame, the file opens in the current document or frame.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145136				0	ca-XR	Open File				20200411 15:09:53
