helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1089D				0	ca-XR	You can show and hide the \<emph\>Visible Buttons\</emph\>. Click the arrow at the end of the toolbar to access the \<emph\>Visible Buttons\</emph\> command.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149398				0	ca-XR	Selection				20200411 15:09:53
