helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150826	63			0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Text_Marquee\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts animated text with horizontal text direction into the current document. Drag a text box, and then type or paste your text. To assign an animation effect, choose \<emph\>Format - Text - Text Animation\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>\<variable id=\"lauftext\"\>Inserts animated text with horizontal text direction into the current document. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149966				0	ca-XR	Callouts				20200411 15:09:53
