helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057A				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>First select some text or an object, then click this icon. Then click on or drag across other text or click an object to apply the same formatting.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
