helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B65				0	ca-XR	\<image id=\"img_id6128727\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_usewizards.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6128727\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
