helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3149290				0	ca-XR	mm				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3152920				0	ca-XR	2				20200411 15:09:53
