helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_RB_STOREINFIELD_YES\"\>Specifies that you want to save the reference values in a database.\</ahelp\> The values are written in the data field selected in the list box. The list box displays all the field names from the database table that the form is linked to.				20200411 15:09:53
