helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154094				0	ca-XR	The default settings will be accepted if you open the form in the user mode. With these settings you determine the control property \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Default Status\"\>Default Status\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
