helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	ca-XR	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>. The \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page of the dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	ca-XR	Click on \<emph\>Properties\</emph\>. This opens the Properties dialog for your printer.				20200411 15:09:53
