helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149233				0	ca-XR	Choose Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Impress or Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Draw, as appropriate.				20200411 15:09:53
