helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573	12			0	ca-XR	Under \<emph\>Quality,\</emph\> select either \<emph\>Grayscale\</emph\> or \<emph\>Black & white\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307				0	ca-XR	When either of these options is selected, all presentations or drawings will be printed without color. If you only want to print in black for the \<emph\>current\</emph\> print job, select the option in \<emph\>File - Print - %PRODUCTNAME Draw/Impress\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149786	15			0	ca-XR	               \<emph\>Grayscale\</emph\> converts all colors to a maximum of 256 gradations from black to white. All text will be printed in black. A background set by \<emph\>Format - Page - Background\</emph\> will not be printed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3145610	16			0	ca-XR	               \<emph\>Black & white\</emph\> converts all colors into the two values black and white. All borders around objects are printed black. All text will be printed in black. A background set by \<emph\>Format - Page - Background\</emph\> will not be printed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153896				0	ca-XR	Printing only text in black and white				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147559				0	ca-XR	In \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer you can choose to print color-formatted text in black and white. You can specify this either for all subsequent text documents to be printed, or only for the current printing process.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150358				0	ca-XR	Printing all text documents with black and white text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541				0	ca-XR	Choose Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer or Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer/Web.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147084				0	ca-XR	Then choose \<emph\>Print\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910	22			0	ca-XR	Under \<emph\>Contents,\</emph\> mark \<emph\>Print black\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762				0	ca-XR	All text documents or HTML documents will be printed with black text.				20200411 15:09:53
