helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3150986				0	ca-XR	Once the data is in a $[officename] Calc spreadsheet, you can edit it as needed. Save the data as a $[officename] data source:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3149762				0	ca-XR	Save the current $[officename] Calc spreadsheet in dBASE format in the folder of a dBASE database. To do this, choose \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\>, then select the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> "dBASE" and the folder of the dBASE database.				20200411 15:09:53
