helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216				0	ca-XR	In \<emph\>File type\</emph\> select the filter "Text CSV". Enter a file name and click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3154908				0	ca-XR	This opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000207.xhp\" name=\"dBase Export\"\>\<emph\>Export of text files\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, in which you can select the character set, field delimiter and text delimiter. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. A warning informs you that only the active sheet was saved.				20200411 15:09:53
