helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200802524413				0	ca-XR	You see the Start Center when no document is open in %PRODUCTNAME. \<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click an icon to open a new document or a file dialog.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
