helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Extended tips\</emph\> provide a brief description of the function of a particular icon, text box or menu command when you rest your cursor on that item.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155339				0	ca-XR	To turn Extended Tips on and off:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	ca-XR	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>, and check \<emph\>Extended tips\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
