helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\formfields.xhp	0	help	par_idN10828				0	ca-XR	Right-click the button and choose \<emph\>Form\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\formfields.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082F				0	ca-XR	The \<emph\>Form Properties\</emph\> dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
