helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN108D5				0	ca-XR	Select the properties from the \<emph\>Drawing Object Properties\</emph\> toolbar. You can change the line width, line color, fill color, fill style, and more.				20200411 15:09:53
