helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id7211218				0	ca-XR	Click the \<emph\>Insert Chart\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
