helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id6436658				0	ca-XR	Chart based on values of its own				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6944792				0	ca-XR	In Writer, if you have not selected any cells, choose \<emph\>Insert - Object - Chart\</emph\> to insert a chart with default data. In Draw or Impress, choose \<emph\>Insert - Chart\</emph\> to insert a chart based on default data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960				0	ca-XR	You can change the default data values by double-clicking on the chart and then choosing \<link href=\"text/schart/01/03010000.xhp\" name=\"View - Chart Data Table\"\>\<emph\>View - Chart Data Table\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
