helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061E				0	ca-XR	In %PRODUCTNAME, you can create a new form using the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01090000.xhp\"\>Form Wizard\</link\>:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10632				0	ca-XR	Open the database file where you want to create the new form.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10636				0	ca-XR	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Forms\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
