helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id7869502				0	ca-XR	Select and download the correct language pack for your version of %PRODUCTNAME software.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id9852900				0	ca-XR	Close %PRODUCTNAME software (also close the Quickstarter, if you enabled it).				20200411 15:09:53
