helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	ca-XR	To send a fax directly from $[officename], you need a fax modem and a fax driver that allows applications to communicate with the fax modem.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166410				0	ca-XR	Sending a Fax Through the Print Dialog				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3152996				0	ca-XR	Open the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog by choosing \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\> and select the fax driver in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> list box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3155135				0	ca-XR	Clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\> opens the dialog for your fax driver, where you can select the fax recipient.				20200411 15:09:53
