helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	ca-XR	You can configure $[officename] so that a single click on an icon automatically sends the current document as a fax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315				0	ca-XR	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040400.xhp\" name=\"Writer - Print\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Print\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3150985				0	ca-XR	Select the fax driver from the \<emph\>Fax\</emph\> list box and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EB				0	ca-XR	Click the arrow icon at the end of the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar. In the drop-down menu, choose \<emph\>Customize\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F6				0	ca-XR	The \<emph\>Toolbar\</emph\>s tab page of the \<emph\>Customize\</emph\> dialog appears.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FA				0	ca-XR	Click \<emph\>Add Commands\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10702				0	ca-XR	Select the "Documents" category, then select the "Send Default Fax" command.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10706				0	ca-XR	Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\> and then \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10712				0	ca-XR	On the \<emph\>Toolbars\</emph\> tab page, click the down arrow button to position the new icon where you want it. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10715				0	ca-XR	Your \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar now has a new icon to send the current document as a fax.				20200411 15:09:53
