helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A6F				0	ca-XR	In the list of filters, select the filter that you want to test, and click \<emph\>Test XSLTs\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
