helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	ca-XR	$[officename] can open and save documents in the Microsoft Office file formats. Microsoft Office Open XML formats can be read, but not saved.				20200411 15:09:53
