helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	ca-XR	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\>. Select a Microsoft Office file in the $[officename] file open dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
