helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3147620				0	ca-XR	$[officename] Writer				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3154898				0	ca-XR	MS Excel, *.xls, *.xlsx				20200411 15:09:53
