helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	ca-XR	Select a style from the \<emph\>Line Style\</emph\> box and specify the width in the \<emph\>Line Width\</emph\> box. A width of 0 corresponds to 1 pixel.				20200411 15:09:53
