helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C1				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_WRAPAROUND\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches the entire Help page, starting at the current position of the cursor.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
