helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154188				0	ca-XR	Allows you to carry out a full-text search. The search will include the entire Help contents of the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> module.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154985				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000150.xhp\" name=\"Bookmarks\"\>Bookmarks\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156062				0	ca-XR	Contains user-defined bookmarks. You can edit or delete bookmarks, or click them to go to the corresponding pages.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	ca-XR	The Help references the default settings of the program on a system that is set to defaults. Descriptions of colors, mouse actions, or other configurable items can be different for your program and system.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150618				0	ca-XR	The \<emph\>$[officename] Help system\</emph\> provides easy access to information and support. There are several ways to find what you are looking for in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"Help environment\"\>Help environment\</link\>: You can search for a specific keyword in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index\"\>Index\</link\>, carry out a full-text search under \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>, or look through a hierarchical list of the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000160.xhp\" name=\"Topics\"\>Topics\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	Managing Bookmarks				20200411 15:09:53
