helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145314				0	ca-XR	Use the \<emph\>Add to Bookmarks\</emph\> icon to set a bookmark for the current page shown in the Help.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	ca-XR	You can find the bookmarks on the \<emph\>Bookmarks\</emph\> tab page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_BOOKMARKS_LB_BOOKMARKS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Double-clicking a bookmark or pressing the Return key opens the assigned page in Help. A right-click opens the context menu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	ca-XR	Use the Del key to delete a selected bookmark.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	ca-XR	The following commands are on the context menu of a bookmark:				20200411 15:09:53
