helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Rename\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_RENAME\" visibility=\"visible\"\>opens a dialog for entering another name for the bookmark\</ahelp\>.				20200411 15:09:53
