helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595296				0	ca-XR	Document language and paragraph language applied by using the menu or status bar 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595242				0	ca-XR	Each recorded item also includes a time stamp and the module (Writer, Calc, Impress, …) where it has been called 				20200411 15:09:53
