helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Defines the settings for the graphics cache and the number of steps you can undo.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
