helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3158408				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"sw:CheckBox:TP_OPTPRINT_PAGE:CB_CTRLFLD\"\>Specifies whether the form control fields of the text document are printed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
