helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146795				0	ca-XR	Save password				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_SSO_CB_PASSWORD\"\>Using "simple" authentication method, check this box to make your password persistent.\</ahelp\> If the password is persistent and the same user starts $[officename] later on, the user name and password will not be requested again. Using "Kerberos", this box is not active.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154939	12			0	ca-XR	The password will be stored encrypted in a file called .ssop in your \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>home directory \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>"My Documents" folder\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20200411 15:09:53
