helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id5616626				0	ca-XR	The Security options and warnings dialog contains the following controls:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10647				0	ca-XR	When saving or sending				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064B				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"703988739\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to save or send a document that contains recorded changes, versions, or comments.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064E				0	ca-XR	When printing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10652				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"703988740\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to print a document that contains recorded changes or comments.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10655				0	ca-XR	When signing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10659				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"703988741\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to sign a document that contains recorded changes, versions, fields, references to other sources (for example linked sections or linked pictures), or comments.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
