helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	Changes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153823				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040700.xhp\" name=\"Changes\"\>Changes\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149416				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REDLINE_OPT\"\>Defines the appearance of changes in the document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156153				0	ca-XR	To record or show changes in your text or spreadsheet document, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02230000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Changes\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Changes - Record\</emph\>\</link\> or \<emph\>Edit - Changes - Show\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	ca-XR	Text display				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3144510				0	ca-XR	Defines the settings for displaying recorded changes. Select the type of change and the corresponding display attribute and color. The preview field shows the effect of the selected display options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148550				0	ca-XR	Insertions / Attributes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_INS_ATTR\"\>Specifies how changes in the document are displayed when text is inserted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152812				0	ca-XR	Deletions / Attributes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_DEL_ATTR\"\>Specifies how changes in the document are displayed when text is deleted. If you record text deletions, the text is displayed with the selected attribute (for example, strikethrough) and is not deleted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148674				0	ca-XR	Changed attributes / Attributes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151042				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_CHG_ATTR\"\>Defines how changes to text attributes are displayed in the document. These changes affect attributes such as bold, italic or underline.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153105				0	ca-XR	Color				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_CHG_COL\"\>You can also choose a color to display each type of recorded change. When you choose the condition "By author" in the list, the color is automatically determined by $[officename], then modified to match to the author of each change.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145607				0	ca-XR	Lines changed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149562				0	ca-XR	To indicate which lines of the text have been changed, you can define a mark that appears in the left or right page margin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145785				0	ca-XR	Mark				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_REDLINE_OPT:LB_MARKPOS\"\>Defines if and where changed lines in the document are marked.\</ahelp\> You can set the markings so that they always appear on the left or right page margin, or on the outer or inner margin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163713				0	ca-XR	Color				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_REDLINE_OPT:LB_LC_COL\"\>Specifies the color for highlighting the changed lines in the text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	Print Options				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147323				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>printing; colors in grayscale\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>grayscale printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>colors; printing in grayscale\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing; warnings\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paper size warning\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148946				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010900.xhp\" name=\"Print Options\"\>Print Options\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150359				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the print setting options.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148451				0	ca-XR	Reduce print data				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910				0	ca-XR	You can reduce the amount of data to be sent to the printer. Reducing the print data increases the print speed because the print files are smaller. This makes it easier for printers with a smaller memory to print. Reducing print data can result in slightly lower print quality.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147085				0	ca-XR	Settings for				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3158407				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_PRINTFILEOUTPUT\"\>Specifies whether the print settings apply to direct printing or to printing to a file.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145786				0	ca-XR	Reduce transparency				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3159154				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCETRANSPARENCY\"\>If you mark this field the transparent objects will be printed like normal, non-transparent objects, depending on your selection in the following two option buttons.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444				0	ca-XR	Transparency cannot be output directly to a printer. The areas of the document in which transparency is to be visible must therefore always be calculated as bitmaps and sent to the printer. Depending on the size of the bitmaps and the print resolution a large amount of data may result.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147441				0	ca-XR	Automatically				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150488				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCETRANSPARENCY_AUTO\"\>Specifies that the transparency is only printed if the transparent area covers less than a quarter of the entire page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149417				0	ca-XR	No transparency				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3153878				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCETRANSPARENCY_NONE\"\>With this option transparency is never printed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149960				0	ca-XR	Reduce bitmaps				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3148455				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCEBITMAPS\"\>Specifies that bitmaps are printed with reduced quality. The resolution can only be reduced and not increased.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149400				0	ca-XR	High/normal print quality				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154510	76			0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCEBITMAPS_NORMAL\"\>High print quality corresponds to a resolution of 300dpi. Normal print quality corresponds to a resolution of 200dpi. \</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146969				0	ca-XR	Resolution				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154270				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_LB_REDUCEBITMAPS_RESOLUTION\"\>Specifies the maximum print quality in dpi. The resolution can only be reduced and not increased.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146789				0	ca-XR	Include transparent objects				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCEBITMAPS_TRANSPARENCY\"\>If this field is marked, the reduction in print quality for bitmaps also applies to the transparent areas of objects.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154362				0	ca-XR	Reduce gradients				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3148914				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCEGRADIENTS\"\>If this field is marked, gradients are printed with reduced quality.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155766				0	ca-XR	Gradient stripes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_NUMERICFIELD_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_NF_REDUCEGRADIENTS_STEPCOUNT\"\>Specifies the maximum number of gradient stripes for printing.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146313				0	ca-XR	Intermediate color				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3145230				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCEGRADIENTS_COLOR\"\>Specifies that gradients are only printed in a single intermediate color.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147323				0	ca-XR	Convert colors to grayscale				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3145150				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_CONVERTTOGREYSCALES\"\>Specifies that all colors are printed only as grayscale.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150646				0	ca-XR	Printer warnings				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154022				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_CONVERTTOGREYSCALES\"\>Defines which warnings appear before printing begins.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147003				0	ca-XR	Paper size				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150206				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_PAPERSIZE\"\>Mark this check box if a certain paper size is needed for printing the current document.\</ahelp\> If the paper size used in the document is not provided by the current printer, you will receive an error message.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155581				0	ca-XR	Paper orientation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3153231				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_PAPERORIENTATION\"\>Mark this check box if you need a certain paper orientation for printing the current document.\</ahelp\> If the format used by the current document is not available from the printer, an error message will appear.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149531				0	ca-XR	Transparency				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3152778				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_TRANSPARENCY\"\>Mark this check box if you always want to be warned if transparent objects are contained in the document.\</ahelp\> If you print such a document, a dialog appears in which you can select if the transparency is to be printed in this print instruction.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	Accessibility				20200411 15:09:53
