helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147531				0	ca-XR	Allow animated graphics				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_ANIMATED_GRAPHICS\"\>Previews animated graphics, such as GIF images, in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264				0	ca-XR	Allow animated text				20200411 15:09:53
