helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#proxy\" name=\"Proxy servers\"\>Proxy servers\</link\> for accessing the Internet can be set up manually as needed.				20200411 15:09:53
