helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\guides.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057B				0	ca-XR	Display Guides				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\guides.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057F				0	ca-XR	Displays or hides guides that you can use to align objects on a page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\guides.xhp	0	help	par_idN10582				0	ca-XR	Snap to Guides				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\guides.xhp	0	help	par_idN10586				0	ca-XR	Automatically aligns objects to vertical and horizontal guides. To override this feature, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option key\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt key \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>when you drag an object.				20200411 15:09:53
