helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155620				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020700.xhp\" name=\"Asian Typography\"\>Asian Typography\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153124				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Set the typographic options for cells or paragraphs in Asian language files. To enable Asian language support, choose \<emph\>Language Settings - Languages\</emph\> in the Options dialog box, and then select the \<emph\>Enabled\</emph\> box in the \<emph\>Asian language support\</emph\> area.\</ahelp\> The Asian typography options are ignored in HTML documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571				0	ca-XR	Line change				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	par_id3147834				0	ca-XR	Set the options for line breaks in Asian language documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145072				0	ca-XR	Apply list of forbidden characters to the beginning and end of line				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153683				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_TRISTATEBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_PARA_ASIAN_CB_AS_FORBIDDEN\"\>Prevents the characters in the list from starting or ending a line. The characters are relocated to either the previous or the next line.\</ahelp\> To edit the list of restricted characters, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01150100.xhp\" name=\"Asian Layout\"\>Asian Layout\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
