helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149096				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_TRISTATEBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_PARA_ASIAN_CB_AS_HANG_PUNC\"\>Prevents commas and periods from breaking the line. Instead, these characters are added to the end of the line, even in the page margin.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
