helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149168	6			0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GRID_TRAVEL_NEW\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a new record into the current table.\</ahelp\>To create a record, click the asterisk (*) button at the bottom of the table view. An empty row is added at the end of the table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152920				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select the type of record that you want to create. $[officename] inserts a number in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> column of the record that corresponds to the type that you select here.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a short name for the record. The short name appears in the \<emph\>Identifier\</emph\> column in the list of records.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
