helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	ca-XR	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Creates a table when you press Enter after typing a series of hyphens (-) or tabs separated by plus signs, that is, +------+---+. Plus signs indicate column dividers, while hyphens and tabs indicate the width of a column.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147219				0	ca-XR	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>+-----------------+---------------+------+\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
