helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3152867				0	ca-XR	If present, both identifiers are written to the DOCTYPE declaration in saved XML files.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150120.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	ca-XR	The public identifier is used to detect the filter when you open a file without specifying a filter.				20200411 15:09:53
