helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148826				0	ca-XR	Conversion				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157				0	ca-XR	Normally in a mixed text selection made of Hangul and Hanja characters, all Hangul characters will be converted to Hanja and all Hanja characters will be converted to Hangul. If you want to convert a mixed text selection only in one direction, use the following conversion options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153585				0	ca-XR	Hangul only				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154142				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVX_MDLG_HANGULHANJA_CB_HANGUL_ONLY\"\>Check to convert only Hangul. Do not convert Hanja.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
