helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id1161534				0	ca-XR	The Data tab page of the Properties dialog for an XML Form document offers some XML forms settings.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id3994567				0	ca-XR	The possible settings of the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page of a control depend on the respective control. You will only see the options that are available for the current control and context. The following fields are available:				20200411 15:09:53
