helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154545				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01050000.xhp\" name=\"Close\"\>Close\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148731				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CloseDoc\"\>Closes the current document without exiting the program.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095	7			0	ca-XR	The \<emph\>Close \</emph\>command closes all of the open windows for the current document.				20200411 15:09:53
