helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FORMAT_HEADER\"\>Adds a header to the current page style. A header is an area in the top page margin, where you can add text or graphics.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
