helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152576				0	ca-XR	Asian layout mode				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	ca-XR	This checkbox is only available if Asian language support is enabled and the text direction is set to vertical. \<ahelp hid=\"SVX_TRISTATEBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ALIGNMENT_BTN_ASIAN_VERTICAL\"\>Aligns Asian characters one below the other in the selected cell(s). If the cell contains more than one line of text, the lines are converted to text columns that are arranged from right to left. Western characters in the converted text are rotated 90 degrees to the right. Asian characters are not rotated.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
