helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154318	28			0	ca-XR	You can still use shortcut keys in \<emph\>Full Screen\</emph\> mode, even though the menus are unavailable. \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>To open the \<emph\>View\</emph\> menu, press Alt+V. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
