helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02200200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151097				0	ca-XR	Opens the selected OLE object with the program that the object was created in.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02200200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	ca-XR	This menu command is inserted into \<emph\>Edit – Objects\</emph\> submenu by the application that created the linked object. Depending on the application, the “Open” command for the OLE object might have a different name.				20200411 15:09:53
