helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_CHAR_EFFECTS_LB_RELIEF\"\>Select a relief effect to apply to the selected text. The embossed relief makes the characters appear as if they are raised above the page. The engraved relief makes the characters appear as if they are pressed into the page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
