helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144740				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TAB_WIZ_TABLENAME_EDIT\"\>Specifies a name for the copy.\</ahelp\> Some databases only accept names containing eight or fewer characters.				20200411 15:09:53
