helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157898				0	ca-XR	Definition and data				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150178				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_RADIOBUTTON_TAB_WIZ_COPYTABLE_RB_DEFDATA\"\>Creates a 1:1 copy of the database table.\</ahelp\> The table definition and the complete data are copied. The table definition includes the table structure and format from different data fields, including special field properties. The field contents supply the data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149346				0	ca-XR	Definition				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_RADIOBUTTON_TAB_WIZ_COPYTABLE_RB_DEF\"\>Copies only the table definition and not the corresponding data.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143267				0	ca-XR	As table view				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153311				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_RADIOBUTTON_TAB_WIZ_COPYTABLE_RB_VIEW\"\>If the database supports Views, you can select this option only when a query is copied in a table container. This option enables you to see and edit a query as a normal table view.\</ahelp\> The table will be filtered in the view with a "Select" SQL statement.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155535				0	ca-XR	Append data				20200411 15:09:53
