helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02text.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056F				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter the path to the text file or files. If you just want one text file, you can use any extension of the file name. If you enter a folder name, the text files in that folder must have the extension *.csv to be recognized as files of the text database.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
