helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard05.xhp	0	help	par_idN10556				0	ca-XR	Specifies whether to group the query. The data source must support the SQL statement "Order by clauses" to enable this page of the Wizard.				20200411 15:09:53
