helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3152780				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Changes the password for the selected user.\</ahelp\> The \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05000003.xhp\" name=\"Change Password\"\>Change Password\</link\> dialog appears.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149398				0	ca-XR	Delete user				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Deletes the selected user.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156152				0	ca-XR	Access rights for user selected				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	ca-XR	Allows you to view and assign access rights for the selected user.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	Enter / change password				20200411 15:09:53
