helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159176				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/30100000.xhp\" name=\"Create New Adabas Database\"\>Create New Adabas Database\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154515				0	ca-XR	Creates a new \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/30000000.xhp\" name=\"Adabas database\"\>Adabas database\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156117				0	ca-XR	Database name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158432				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_DBNAME\"\>Type the name of the database.\</ahelp\> The name is added to the \<emph\>Data source URL\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150256				0	ca-XR	User settings				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155628				0	ca-XR	Administrator				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_SYSUSR\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the name of the database administrator.\</ahelp\> The administrator name and password is assigned when you create an Adabas database. Apart from the administrator, two more users can access the Adabas database.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149045				0	ca-XR	Control User				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_CONUSR\"\>Enter the name of a user that you want to give limited control to modify some parameters of the database. Normally, the default settings for the name and the password of the control user are not changed.\</ahelp\> The control user does not affect the three-user limitation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153379				0	ca-XR	Domain User				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153362				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_USR\"\>Enter the name of the domain user that is used by Adabas internally. Normally, the default settings for the name and password of the domain user are not changed.\</ahelp\> The domain user does not affect the three-user limit.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147084				0	ca-XR	Password				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148674				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_DOMAINPWD\"\>Enter a password.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144433				0	ca-XR	Database settings				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145607				0	ca-XR	Drives containing parts of the Serverdb are called DEVSPACEs. To improve performance, store each DEVSPACE on separate drives.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146985				0	ca-XR	The file path for a DEVSPACE, including its file name, cannot exceed 40 characters.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146148				0	ca-XR	SYSDEVSPACE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149064				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_SYSDEVSPACE\"\>Enter the path for the system DEVSPACE.\</ahelp\> The SYSDEVSPACE manages the configuration data for the database. The size of the SYSDEVSPACE depends on the size of the database.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147319				0	ca-XR	TRANSACTIONLOG				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154190				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_TRANSACTIONLOG\"\>Enter the path for the transaction log file.\</ahelp\> This file records all modifications that are made to the database during a transaction, and overwrites them when the transaction is completed. The TRANSACTIONLOG is also used for the rollback of a transaction.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145748				0	ca-XR	DATADEVSPACE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152597				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_DATADEVSPACE\"\>Enter the path for the data DEVSPACE.\</ahelp\> This file stores user data, such as tables and indexes, as well as the SQL catalog (schema info). The data contained in one user table is evenly distributed across all DATADEVSPACEs. The combined size of all DATADEVSPACEs corresponds to the size of the database.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	ca-XR	The maximum size for a DATADEVSPACE in the limited version Adabas database is 100MB.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426				0	ca-XR	If the DATADEVSPACE reaches full capacity during a database operation, Adabas shuts down, increases the capacity of the DATADEVSPACE (up to 100 MB), and restarts the database. Saved data is not lost.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153189				0	ca-XR	...				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153091				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_PBDATADEVSPACE\"\>Locate the directory where you want to save the file, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150686				0	ca-XR	Transaction file (MB)				20200411 15:09:53
