helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154948				0	ca-XR	If there is an error when assigning properties to the objects contained in the form (for example, when assigning a non-existent database table to an object), a corresponding error message appears. This error message may contain a \<emph\>More\</emph\> button. \<ahelp hid=\"dummy\"\>If you click \<emph\>More\</emph\>, a dialog displaying more information about the current problem appears.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
