helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	hd_id3919186				0	ca-XR	To choose a chart type				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id3453169				0	ca-XR	Choose a basic \<link href=\"text/schart/01/choose_chart_type.xhp\"\>chart type\</link\>: click any of the entries labeled Column, Bar, Pie, and so on.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id8406933				0	ca-XR	The contents on the right side will change to offer more options depending on the basic chart type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id8230231				0	ca-XR	Optionally, click any of the options. While you change the settings in the wizard, watch the preview in the document to see how the chart will look.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id3267006				0	ca-XR	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Shift+F1\</item\> and point to a control to see an extended help text.				20200411 15:09:53
