helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	ca-XR	Modifies the alignment of axes or title labels.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	ca-XR	Some of the options listed here are not available for all labels. For example, there are different options for 2D and 3D object labels.				20200411 15:09:53
