helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id2507400				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Positions the legend to the top of the chart.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
