helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id7366557				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays grid lines that are perpendicular to the z-axis. This option is only available for three-dimensional charts.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6527298				0	ca-XR	The visible grid lines can help to estimate the data values in the chart.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id2924283				0	ca-XR	The distance of the grid lines corresponds to the interval settings in the Scale tab of the axis properties.				20200411 15:09:53
