helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3145593	56			0	ca-XR	If you want the selected custom slide show to start when you click the \<emph\>Slide Show\</emph\> icon on the\<emph\> Presentation\</emph\> toolbar, or when you press F5, select \<emph\>Use Custom Slide Show\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
