helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id5377056				0	ca-XR	To create a closed shape, double-click the starting point of the line.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id3153919				0	ca-XR	Click and release the mouse button to add an anchor point. Move the mouse to draw the next segment.				20200411 15:09:53
