helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\show.xhp	0	help	par_id4199957				0	ca-XR	If you want all shows to start from the current slide instead of the first slide, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Impress - General\</emph\> and click \<emph\>Always with current page\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
