helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\show.xhp	0	help	par_id4959257				0	ca-XR	When you create a new slide show using the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01050000.xhp\"\>Presentation Wizard\</link\>, you can select the duration of slides and of the pause, on the third wizard page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\show.xhp	0	help	hd_id1906491				0	ca-XR	Running a slide show from a file				20200411 15:09:53
