helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3155960				0	ca-XR	You can convert text characters into curves that you can edit and resize as you would any drawing object. Once you convert text into a drawing object, you can no longer edit the content of the text.				20200411 15:09:53
