helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3150395				0	ca-XR	In $[officename] Impress, right-click the border of the text object, and then choose \<emph\>Convert - To Curve\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
