helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\arrange_slides.xhp	0	help	par_id3153079				0	ca-XR	To temporarily remove a slide from your presentation, go to \<emph\>Slide Sorter\</emph\>, right-click the slide, and then choose \<emph\>Show/Hide Slide\</emph\>. The number of the hidden slide is crossed out. To show the slide, right-click the slide, and then choose \<emph\>Show/Hide Slide\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
