helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146119				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13050700.xhp\" name=\"To Contour\"\>To Contour\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050700.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:convert_to_contour\"\>Converts the selected object to a polygon, or a group of polygons.\</ahelp\> If the conversion creates a group of polygons (for example, when you convert a text object), then press F3 to enter the group before you can select an individual polygon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050700.xhp	0	help	par_id3155601	3			0	ca-XR	Once you convert a line or a text object to a contour, you can no longer edit it as you normally would. Instead, you can edit the contour as you would any polygon, including using the \<emph\>Edit – Points \</emph\>command to adjust its shape.				20200411 15:09:53
