helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154759				0	ca-XR	\<variable id=\"multitables\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/multitables.xhp\" name=\"Applying Multiple Sheets\"\>Applying Multiple Sheets\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148576				0	ca-XR	Inserting a Sheet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id3154731				0	ca-XR	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Sheet\</item\> to insert a new sheet or an existing sheet from another file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id05092009140203598				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Opens a dialog box where you can assign macros to sheet events.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id05092009140203523				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Opens a window where you can assign a color to the sheet tab.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id050920091402035				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to select all sheets in the document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id0509200914020391				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to deselect all sheets in the document, except the current sheet.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154491				0	ca-XR	Selecting Multiple Sheets				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id3145251				0	ca-XR	The sheet tab of the current sheet is always visible in white in front of the other sheet tabs. The other sheet tabs are gray when they are not selected. By clicking other sheet tabs while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>you can select multiple sheets.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B7				0	ca-XR	You can use Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Up or Page Down to select multiple sheets using the keyboard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155600				0	ca-XR	Undoing a Selection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id3146969				0	ca-XR	To undo the selection of a sheet, click its sheet tab again while pressing the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>key. The sheet that is currently visible cannot be removed from the selection.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156382				0	ca-XR	Calculating Across Multiple Sheets				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id3155333				0	ca-XR	You can refer to a range of sheets in a formula by specifying the first and last sheet of the range, for example, \<item type=\"literal\"\>=SUM(Sheet1.A1:Sheet3.A1) \</item\>sums up all A1 cells on Sheet1 through Sheet3.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	Changing Row Height or Column Width				20200411 15:09:53
