helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151112				0	ca-XR	\<variable id=\"text_rotate\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/text_rotate.xhp\" name=\"Rotating Text\"\>Rotating Text\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
