helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	ca-XR	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Select All\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3153815				0	ca-XR	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - AutoFormat\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A9				0	ca-XR	Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN10760				0	ca-XR	In the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box of the \<emph\>Add AutoFormat\</emph\> dialog, enter a name for the format.				20200411 15:09:53
