helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellcopy.xhp	0	help	par_id3166427				0	ca-XR	Cells were hidden using the \<emph\>Hide\</emph\> command in the context menu of the row or column headers, or through an \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12080000.xhp\" name=\"outline\"\>outline\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
