helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154370				0	ca-XR	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3146114				0	ca-XR	YEARS(StartDate; EndDate; Type)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3145387				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>StartDate\</emph\> is the first date				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3156290				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>EndDate\</emph\> is the second date				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3152893				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> calculates the type of difference. Possible values are 0 (interval) and 1 (in calendar years).				20200411 15:09:53
