helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id393993				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select a solver engine. The listbox is disabled if only one solver engine is installed. Solver engines can be installed as extensions.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
