helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id5787224				0	ca-XR	INFO				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id1507309				0	ca-XR	Returns specific information about the current working environment. The function receives a single text argument and returns data depending on that parameter.				20200411 15:09:53
