helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3144744				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_BIN2DEC\"\>The result is the decimal number for the binary number entered.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
