helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3151020				0	ca-XR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DELTA(1;2)\</item\> returns 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	bm_id3157971				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>DEC2BIN function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting;decimal numbers, into binary numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
