helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3150662				0	ca-XR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DEC2BIN(100;8)\</item\> returns 01100100.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149388				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>DEC2HEX function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting;decimal numbers, into hexadecimal numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
