helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	bm_id3083446				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>ERF function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Gaussian error integral\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
