helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166231				0	ca-XR	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3166245				0	ca-XR	Select a spreadsheet range in which the trend data will appear. Select the function. Enter the output data or select it with the mouse. Mark the \<emph\>Array\</emph\> field. click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The trend data calculated from the output data is displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	bm_id3166317				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>GROWTH function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>exponential trends in arrays\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
