helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3173797				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>NewDataX\</emph\> (optional) represents the X data array, in which the values are recalculated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3173817				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>FunctionType\</emph\>(optional). If FunctionType = 0, functions in the form y = m^x will be calculated. Otherwise, y = b*m^x functions will be calculated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11DFD				0	ca-XR	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
