helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3173839				0	ca-XR	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3173852				0	ca-XR	This function returns an array and is handled in the same way as the other array functions. Select a range where you want the answers to appear and select the function. Select DataY. Enter any other parameters, mark \<emph\>Array\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
