helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3153538				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MONAT\"\>Returns the month for the given date value.\</ahelp\> The month is returned as an integer between 1 and 12.				20200411 15:09:53
