helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3145602				0	ca-XR	MONTH(Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3149485				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Number\</emph\>, as a time value, is a decimal for which the month is to be returned.				20200411 15:09:53
