helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3149244				0	ca-XR	=MONTH(NOW()) returns the current month.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3154790				0	ca-XR	=MONTH(C4) returns 7 if you enter 2000-07-07 to cell C4 (that date value might get formatted differently after you press Enter).				20200411 15:09:53
