helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149530				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>LARGE function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149530				0	ca-XR	LARGE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3150518				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_KGROESSTE\"\>Returns the Rank_c-th largest value in a data set.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
