helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3152986				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Data\</emph\> is the cell range of data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3156448				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>RankC\</emph\> is the ranking of the value.				20200411 15:09:53
