helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3148702				0	ca-XR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=LARGE(A1:C50;2)\</item\> gives the second largest value in A1:C50.				20200411 15:09:53
