helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3153335				0	ca-XR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=CONFIDENCE(0.05;1.5;100)\</item\> gives 0.29.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148746				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>CORREL function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>coefficient of correlation\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148746				0	ca-XR	CORREL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3147299				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_KORREL\"\>Returns the correlation coefficient between two data sets.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156397				0	ca-XR	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3153023				0	ca-XR	CORREL(Data1; Data2)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3150036				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Data1\</emph\> is the first data set.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3153021				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Data2\</emph\> is the second data set.				20200411 15:09:53
