helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3146875				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_KOVAR\"\>Returns the covariance of the product of paired deviations.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
