helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3145827				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Data1\</emph\> is the first data set.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3150465				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Data2\</emph\> is the second data set.				20200411 15:09:53
