helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3145593				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Trials\</emph\> is the total number of trials.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3153084				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>SP\</emph\> is the probability of success for one trial.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3149726				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Alpha\</emph\> is the threshold probability to be reached or exceeded.				20200411 15:09:53
