helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3154734				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_FISHERINV\"\>Returns the inverse of the Fisher transformation for x and creates a function close to a normal distribution.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
