helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3150032	32			0	ca-XR	            \<emph\>Data1\</emph\> is the first record array.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3153018	33			0	ca-XR	            \<emph\>Data2\</emph\> is the second record array.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153123				0	ca-XR	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3159126	35			0	ca-XR	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=FTEST(A1:A30;B1:B12)\</item\> calculates whether the two data sets are different in their variance and returns the probability that both sets could have come from the same total population.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150372				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>FDIST function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
