helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3150461	41			0	ca-XR	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the value for which the F distribution is to be calculated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3150029	42			0	ca-XR	            \<emph\>degreesFreedom1\</emph\> is the degrees of freedom in the numerator in the F distribution.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3146877	43			0	ca-XR	            \<emph\>degreesFreedom2\</emph\> is the degrees of freedom in the denominator in the F distribution.				20200411 15:09:53
