helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3150696	45			0	ca-XR	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=FDIST(0.8;8;12)\</item\> yields 0.61.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	bm_id0119200903223192				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>GAMMA function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
