helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150373				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MITTELABW\"\>Returns the average of the absolute deviations of data points from their mean.\</ahelp\> Displays the diffusion in a data set.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150038				0	ca-XR	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3145636				0	ca-XR	AVEDEV(Number1; Number2; ...Number30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3157871				0	ca-XR	\<emph\>Number1, Number2,...Number30\</emph\> are values or ranges that represent a sample. Each number can also be replaced by a reference.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149725				0	ca-XR	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153122				0	ca-XR	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=AVEDEV(A1:A50)\</item\>         				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145824				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>AVERAGE function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
