helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153622				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_LINKS\"\>Returns the first character or characters of a text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
