helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057A				0	ca-XR	Specifies whether to enter the start value for grouping yourself.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	ca-XR	End				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10581				0	ca-XR	Specifies the end of the grouping.				20200411 15:09:53
