helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10588				0	ca-XR	Specifies whether to end grouping at the largest value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058B				0	ca-XR	Manually at				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058F				0	ca-XR	Specifies whether to enter the end value for grouping yourself.				20200411 15:09:53
