helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3151234				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_STABWA\"\>Calculates the standard deviation of an estimation based on a sample.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
