helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3148581	192			0	ca-XR	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=STDEVA(A1:A50)\</item\> returns the estimated standard deviation based on the data referenced.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149734				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>STDEVP function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>standard deviations in statistics;based on a population\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
