helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145591				0	ca-XR	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3153933	44			0	ca-XR	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=STDEVP(A1:A50)\</item\> returns a standard deviation of the data referenced.				20200411 15:09:53
