helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3155984	70			0	ca-XR	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=NORMSDIST(1)\</item\> returns 0.84. The area below the standard normal distribution curve to the left of X value 1 is 84% of the total area.				20200411 15:09:53
