helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150592				0	ca-XR	A security is purchased on 2001-01-25; the date of maturity is 2001-11-15. Interest is paid half-yearly (frequency is 2). Using daily balance interest calculation (basis 3) how many days is this?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151103				0	ca-XR	=COUPDAYBS("2001-01-25"; "2001-11-15"; 2; 3) returns 71.				20200411 15:09:53
