helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149912				0	ca-XR	ATANH(Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150521	134			0	ca-XR	 This function returns the inverse hyperbolic tangent of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the number whose hyperbolic tangent is Number. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id9357280				0	ca-XR	 Number must obey the condition -1 < number < 1.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148450				0	ca-XR	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	ca-XR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ATANH(0)\</item\> returns 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153062				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>COS function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
