helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153234				0	ca-XR	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154099				0	ca-XR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=COSH(0)\</item\> returns 1, the hyperbolic cosine of 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152888				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>COT function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
