helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144754				0	ca-XR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=COTH(1)\</item\> returns the hyperbolic cotangent of 1, approximately 1.3130.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145314				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>DEGREES function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting;radians, into degrees\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
