helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3459578				0	ca-XR	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DEGREES(PI())\</item\> returns 180 degrees.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148698				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>EXP function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
