helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156450				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DataSelect\"\>A list box containing all text found in the current column is displayed.\</ahelp\> The text is sorted alphabetically and multiple entries are listed only once.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	ca-XR	Click one of the listed entries to copy it to the cell.				20200411 15:09:53
