helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05020600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156283				0	ca-XR	This cell protection only takes effect if you also protect the sheet (\<emph\>Tools - Protect Document - Sheet\</emph\>).				20200411 15:09:53
