helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146899				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoSum\"\>Activates the sum function. Note that the cursor must be in the cell where you want the sum to appear.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
