helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145086				0	ca-XR	\<variable id=\"load_styles\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/load_styles.xhp\" name=\"Using Styles From Another Document or Template\"\>Using Styles From Another Document or Template\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491				0	ca-XR	You can import styles from another document or template into the current document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3155910				0	ca-XR	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_idN10703				0	ca-XR	Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>New Style from Selection\</emph\> icon to open the submenu.				20200411 15:09:53
