helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632				0	ca-XR	Use the check boxes at the bottom of the dialog to select the style types that you want to import. To replace styles in the current document that have the same name as the ones you are importing, select \<emph\>Overwrite\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3145098				0	ca-XR	Do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
