helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3153153				0	ca-XR	In the list of page styles, right-click "Left Page" and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3153179				0	ca-XR	Click the \<emph\>Organizer\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
