helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3149842				0	ca-XR	$[officename] can insert line numbers in an entire document or to selected paragraphs in your document. Line numbers are included when you print your document. You can specify the line numbering interval, the starting line number, and whether to count blank lines or lines in frames. You can also add a separator between line numbers.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id7184972				0	ca-XR	Line numbers are not available in HTML format.				20200411 15:09:53
