helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382				0	ca-XR	Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formula\</item\> icon, and choose "Mean" from the Statistical Functions list.				20200411 15:09:53
