helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B2				0	ca-XR	For paragraph and character styles, you can drag-and-drop onto the respective icon in the Styles and Formatting window. You do not need to open that style category in advance.				20200411 15:09:53
