helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	Rearranging a Document by Using the Navigator				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149973				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>headings;rearranging\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>rearranging headings\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>moving;headings\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>demoting heading levels\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>promoting heading levels\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Navigator;heading levels and chapters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>arranging;headings\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>outlines;arranging chapters\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149973				0	ca-XR	\<variable id=\"arrange_chapters\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/arrange_chapters.xhp\" name=\"Rearranging a Document by Using the Navigator\"\>Arranging Chapters in the Navigator\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147795	59			0	ca-XR	You can move headings and subordinate text up and down in a document text by using the Navigator. You can also promote and demote heading levels. To use this feature, format the headings in your document with one of the predefined heading paragraph styles. To use a custom paragraph style for a heading, choose \<emph\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\>, select the style in the \<emph\>Paragraph Style \</emph\>box, and then double-click a number in the \<emph\>Levels \</emph\>list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145652	62			0	ca-XR	To quickly move the text cursor to a heading in the document, double-click the heading in the \<emph\>Navigator \</emph\>list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155461				0	ca-XR	To dock the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, drag the title bar to the edge of the workspace. To undock the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, double-click its frame.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151184				0	ca-XR	To Move a Heading Up or Down in the Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id0915200809400790				0	ca-XR	Ensure that all heading levels are shown in the Navigator. By default all levels are shown. See steps below how to change the heading levels that are shown.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151206	71			0	ca-XR	On the \<emph\>Standard Bar\</emph\>, click the\<emph\> Navigator\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id5211883\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_navigator.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5211883\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> to open the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151238	72			0	ca-XR	On the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Content View\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3156338\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20234.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156338\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155089				0	ca-XR	Do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155114	63			0	ca-XR	Drag a heading to a new location in the \<emph\>Navigator \</emph\>list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155139	75			0	ca-XR	Click a heading in the \<emph\>Navigator \</emph\>list, and then click the \<emph\>Promote Chapter\</emph\>\<image id=\"img_id4217546\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20174.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id4217546\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> or \<emph\>Demote Chapter \</emph\>icon \<image id=\"img_id6505788\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20171.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6505788\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145758	64			0	ca-XR	To move the heading without the subordinate text, hold down Ctrl while you drag or click the \<emph\>Promote Chapter \</emph\>or \<emph\>Demote Chapter \</emph\>icons.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155402				0	ca-XR	To Promote or Demote the Level of a Heading				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155424	77			0	ca-XR	Select the heading in the \<emph\>Navigator \</emph\>list. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_idN1081C				0	ca-XR	Click the \<emph\>Promote Level \</emph\>\<image id=\"img_id5564488\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20172.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5564488\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> or \<emph\>Demote Level \</emph\>icon \<image id=\"img_id3159363\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20173.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159363\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155525				0	ca-XR	To Change the Number of Heading Levels That Are Displayed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151352	79			0	ca-XR	Click the \<emph\>Heading Levels Shown \</emph\>icon \<image id=\"img_id3151310\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20236.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151310\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>, and then select a number from the list.				20200411 15:09:53
