helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3149692				0	ca-XR	To insert a scanned image, the scanner must be connected to your system and the scanner software drivers must be installed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3155182	3			0	ca-XR	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>The scanner must support the TWAIN standard. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>The scanner must support the SANE standard.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3155915				0	ca-XR	Click in the document where you want to insert the scanned image.				20200411 15:09:53
