helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id2165898				0	ca-XR	This guide is about inserting graphical rules. You can also insert other lines, see \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/line_intext.xhp\"\>Drawing Lines in Text\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3149691				0	ca-XR	Click in the document where you want to insert the line.				20200411 15:09:53
