helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id8230842				0	ca-XR	You can easily insert a page number field in the footer of your document. You can also add a page count to the footer, for example, in the form "Page 9 of 12"				20200411 15:09:53
