helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3155532				0	ca-XR	Click in front of the page number field, type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Page\</item\> and enter a space; click after the field, enter a space and then type \<item type=\"literal\"\>of\</item\> and enter another space.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3155554				0	ca-XR	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Page Count\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
