helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3154844				0	ca-XR	You can also right-click the text object, choose \<emph\>Position and Size\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Rotation\</emph\> tab, and then enter a rotation angle or a new position for the object.				20200411 15:09:53
