helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149686				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>words; counting in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>number of words\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>documents; number of words/characters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text; number of words/characters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>characters; counting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>number of characters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>counting words\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>word counts\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149686				0	ca-XR	\<variable id=\"words_count\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/words_count.xhp\" name=\"Counting Words\"\>Counting Words\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D1				0	ca-XR	If you want to count only some text of your document, select the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id3149821				0	ca-XR	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Word Count\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	hd_id1116200901133957				0	ca-XR	How does %PRODUCTNAME count words?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id1116200901133998				0	ca-XR	In general, every string of characters between two spaces is a word. Tabs, line breaks, and paragraph breaks are word limits, too.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id1116200901133985				0	ca-XR	Words with dashes or always visible hyphens, as in plug-in, add-on, user/config, are counted as one word each.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id111620090113399				0	ca-XR	The words can be a mix of letters, numbers, and special characters. So the following text counts as four words: abc123 1.23 "$" http://www.example.com.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E2				0	ca-XR	To get some more statistics about the document, choose \<emph\>File - Properties - Statistics\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id3147418				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01100400.xhp\" name=\"File - Properties - Statistics\"\>File - Properties - Statistics\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
