helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN10794				0	ca-XR	By default, you accept the word completion by pressing the Enter key. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079B				0	ca-XR	 To reject the word completion, continue typing with any other key. 				20200411 15:09:53
