helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_newaddblo.xhp	0	help	par_idN10574				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Adds the selected field from the Address Elements list to the other list.\</ahelp\> You can add the same field more than once.				20200411 15:09:53
