helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04190000.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BD				0	ca-XR	To always have the latest version of the contents of a file, insert a section into your document, and then insert a link to the text file in the section. See \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020100.xhp\"\>insert a section\</link\> for details.				20200411 15:09:53
