helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN1076E				0	ca-XR	Browse				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN10772				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"878711313\"\>Opens a file open dialog where you can select a database file (*.odb). The selected file is added to the Databases Selection list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155084				0	ca-XR	User defined				20200411 15:09:53
