helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145799				0	ca-XR	\<bookmark_value\>databases; exchanging\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>address books; exchanging\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>exchanging databases\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>replacing;databases\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145799				0	ca-XR	Exchange Database				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156384	2			0	ca-XR	\<variable id=\"datenbankaustext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ChangeDatabaseField\"\>Change the data sources for the current document.\</ahelp\> To correctly display the contents of inserted fields, the replacement database must contain identical field names. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153818				0	ca-XR	For example, if you inserting address fields in a form letter from an address database, you can then exchange the database with another address database to insert different addresses.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149130				0	ca-XR	Exchanging Databases				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651				0	ca-XR	You can only change one database at a time in this dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146965				0	ca-XR	Databases in Use				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149053				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MODALDIALOG_DLG_CHANGE_DB\"\>Lists the databases that are currently in use.\</ahelp\> The current document contains at least one data field from each of the databases in the list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147300				0	ca-XR	Available Databases				20200411 15:09:53
