helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154506				0	ca-XR	To exchange a database:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149881				0	ca-XR	Ensure that both databases contain matching field names and field types.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148386				0	ca-XR	Click in the document that you want to change the data source for.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150564				0	ca-XR	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Exchange Database\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153925				0	ca-XR	In the \<emph\>Databases in Use\</emph\> list, select the database table that you want to replace.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147169				0	ca-XR	In the \<emph\>Available Databases\</emph\> list, select the replacement database table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151273				0	ca-XR	Click \<emph\>Define\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
