helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149358				0	ca-XR	Contour				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155793				0	ca-XR	\<variable id=\"konturtext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:WrapContour\"\>Wraps text around the shape of the object. This option is not available for the \<emph\>Through\</emph\> wrap type, or for frames.\</ahelp\> To change the contour of an object, select the object, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Wrap - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060201.xhp\" name=\"Edit Contour\"\>\<emph\>Edit Contour\</emph\>\</link\>. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154620				0	ca-XR	Only outside				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147377				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_FRM_WRAP:CB_ONLYOUTSIDE\"\>Wraps text only around the contour of the object, but not in open areas within the object shape.\</ahelp\> This option is not available for frames.				20200411 15:09:53
