helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149173				0	ca-XR	Type the text that you want to hide if a condition is met.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151028				0	ca-XR	Characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3145771				0	ca-XR	Enter the characters that you want to combine. You can combine a maximum of 6 characters. This option is only available for the \<emph\>Combine characters\</emph\> field type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156369				0	ca-XR	Value				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3151370				0	ca-XR	Enter a value for the selected field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148877				0	ca-XR	Macro				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3155912				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_TP_FLD_FUNC_BT_FUNCMACRO\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Macro Selector\</emph\>, where you can choose the macro that will run when you click the selected field in the document.\</ahelp\> This button is only available for the "Execute macro" function field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150111				0	ca-XR	The following controls are displayed for \<emph\>Input list\</emph\> fields:				20200411 15:09:53
