helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147618				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_FLD_FUNC_LB_LISTITEMS\"\>Lists the items. The topmost item is shown in the document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
