helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	par_id3154100	2			0	ca-XR	\<variable id=\"eintraege\"\>Specify the format of the alphabetical index entries. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	par_id3153532				0	ca-XR	Level "S" refers to the single letter headings that divide the index entries alphabetically. To enable these headings, select the \<emph\>Alphabetical delimiter\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152957				0	ca-XR	Chapter Info				20200411 15:09:53
