helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810				0	ca-XR	Use Paragraph Styles to format paragraphs, including the font type and size. You can also select the paragraph style to apply to the next paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
