helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148999				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVIGATOR_LISTBOX\"\>Lists the names of all open text documents. To view the contents of a document in the Navigator window, select the name of the document in the list. The current document displayed in the Navigator is indicated by the word "active" after its name in the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149025				0	ca-XR	You can also right-click an item in the Navigator, choose \<emph\>Display\</emph\>, and then click the document that you want to view.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	Outline & Numbering				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151173				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05030800.xhp\" name=\"Numbering\"\>Outline & Numbering\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154100				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NUMPARA\"\>Adds or removes outline level, numbering, or bullets from the paragraph. You can also select the style of numbering to use, and reset the numbering in a numbered list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3153536	14			0	ca-XR	To change the numbering options for paragraphs that use the same paragraph style, choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and \</emph\>Formatting, and then click the \<emph\>Paragraph Styles \</emph\>icon. Right-click the style in the list, choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>, and then click the\<emph\> Outline & Numbering\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154470	26			0	ca-XR	To change the numbering options for selected paragraphs, choose \<emph\>Format -\</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030000.xhp\" name=\"Paragraph\"\>\<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>\</link\>, and then click the\<emph\> Outline & Numbering\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id1209200804371034				0	ca-XR	Outline level				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id1209200804371097				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Assigns an outline level from 1 to 10 to the selected paragraphs or Paragraph Style.\</ahelp\> Select \<emph\>Body text\</emph\> to reset the outline level.				20200411 15:09:53
