helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147100				0	ca-XR	Allow table to split across pages and columns				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153629				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TABLE_TEXTFLOW:CB_SPLIT\"\>Allows a page break or column break between the rows of a table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090300.xhp	0	help	par_idN108D6				0	ca-XR	Allow row to break across pages and columns				20200411 15:09:53
