helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155537				0	ca-XR	To quickly insert a field from the list, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and double-click the field.				20200411 15:09:53
