helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	Create AutoAbstract				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148570				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/01160300.xhp\" name=\"Create AutoAbstract\"\>Create AutoAbstract\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149286	2			0	ca-XR	\<variable id=\"autoabstracttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CreateAbstract\"\>Copies the headings and a number of subsequent paragraphs in the active document to a new AutoAbstract text document. An AutoAbstract is useful for obtaining an overview of long documents.\</ahelp\> You can specify the number of outline levels as well as the number of paragraphs displayed therein. All levels and paragraphs under the respective settings are hidden. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147516				0	ca-XR	Included Outline Levels				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149804				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_INSERT_ABSTRACT:NF_LEVEL\"\>Enter the extent of the outline levels to be copied to the new document.\</ahelp\> For example, if you choose 4 levels, all paragraphs formatted with Heading 1 to Heading 4 are included, along with the number of subsequent paragraphs specified in \<emph\>Subpoints per Level\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151316				0	ca-XR	Subpoints per Level				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_INSERT_ABSTRACT:NF_PARA\"\>Specify the maximum number of consecutive paragraphs to be included in the AutoAbstract document after each heading.\</ahelp\> All of the paragraphs up to the maximum defined are included until the next paragraph with a Heading Style is reached.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ca-XR	DocInformation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154479				0	ca-XR	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090004.xhp\" name=\"DocInformation\"\>DocInformation\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149692				0	ca-XR	DocInformation fields contain information about the properties of a document, such as the date a document was created. To view the properties of a document, choose \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3148982				0	ca-XR	When you export and import an HTML document containing DocInformation fields, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090007.xhp#dokumentinfo\" name=\"special $[officename] formats\"\>special $[officename] formats\</link\> are used.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id0902200804290053				0	ca-XR	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the available field types. To add a field to your document, click a field type, click a field in the Select list, and then click Insert.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
