helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153126				0	ca-XR	Displays the text that is linked to a condition.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153140				0	ca-XR	Formula				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154624				0	ca-XR	Displays the formula of a formula field.				20200411 15:09:53
